WEBVTT

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.350
I asked one website for one moving quote.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.642
Then the calls started.

00:00:07.642 --> 00:00:09.050
And they didn't stop.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.820
A lot of moving sites sell your number.

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:16.750
One request, sold to every mover who pays.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.196
This one doesn't ask for it.

00:00:19.196 --> 00:00:21.800
Plan your whole move, and nobody calls you.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.249
Plan your move without the calls.

00:00:25.249 --> 00:00:26.582
packedrabbit.com.

00:00:26.582 --> 00:00:31.125
If this helped, like it, share it with someone who's moving, and subscribe.
